Fix the useEffect race condition in /app/frontend/src/pages/Marketplace.jsx lines 46-51. Suggested fix: introduce `const wasOpenRef = useRef(false);` and guard the navigate call so it only fires when the dialog was previously opened and is now being closed. Example:

  const wasOpenRef = useRef(false);
  useEffect(() => {
    if (openCreate) wasOpenRef.current = true;
    if (!openCreate && wasOpenRef.current && location.pathname === '/marketplace/new') {
      navigate('/marketplace', { replace: true });
    }
  }, [openCreate]);

This preserves the /marketplace/new URL while the dialog is open (so the tab is bookmarkable / shareable) and only rewrites once the user actually dismisses the dialog.
